    },
    {
      "text": "In k vs T",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\\(\\ln \\mathrm{k~vs~} 1 / \\mathrm{T}\\)",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : Arrhenius equation gives us\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& k=A e^{-E_a / R T} \\\\\n& \\ln k=\\ln A-\\frac{E_a}{R}\\left(\\frac{1}{T}\\right) \\\\\n& y=c-m x\n\\end{aligned}\\)\n<img src=\"assets\\st0007_5bd4bb322d1a.png\"><br>"
